WEBVTT

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:04.250
Review one detected pattern in its chart
context.

00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:09.650
First, check the market and the selected
timeframe.

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:14.390
Open Scanner beneath the chart.

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:21.370
Choose one result and read the pattern name.

00:00:24.530 --> 00:00:28.230
Check whether its direction is bullish,
bearish, or neutral.

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:33.750
Its score is a review cue, not a win
probability.

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:39.510
Turn on Patterns to see the available chart
overlay.

00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:45.109
Compare the overlay with the candles you are
viewing.

00:00:48.530 --> 00:00:50.830
Look for evidence that could contradict the
idea.

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:58.770
If the setup is unclear, wait and ask your
instructor.
